<title>CHILE: TENNIS-RESULTS OF CHILEAN ATP MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS OF CHILEAN ATP MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the third round of</p>
<p>the Hellmann's Cup ATP tennis tournament on Friday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat 7-Fernando Meligeni (Brazil) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>2-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Oliver Gross (Germany) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>3-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat 5-Marcelo Filippini</p>
<p>(Uruguay) 3-6 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>4-Hernan Gumy (Argentina) beat Emilio Alvarez (Spain) 7-6</p>
<p>(11-9) 7-6 (7-3)</p>
</text>
